opengrid (1.6-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * New File Transfer tab: SSH/SFTP, SMB, FTP and TFTP protocols (client + server modes)
  * SMB server configuration: Share Name, Comment, Workgroup, Valid Users, Guest access, Read-only
  * FTP server via pyftpdlib with pkexec elevation for privileged port 21
  * Transfer tab: collapsible log panel with timestamps; unified START/STOP button per protocol
  * Serial quick connect redesigned: grouped tree, drag-and-drop reordering, context menu, rename group
  * Vertical tab order: SSH, Serial, IP Scan, Traceroute, SNMP, WiFi Survey, Speed, Transfer
  * New About dialog in sidebar with description, author info, photo and GitHub link
  * New official app icon: gradient O with C cutout (opengrid_icon.svg)
  * Scalable SVG icon installed in hicolor theme for all packaging formats
  * Serial tab: replace port-type QComboBox with toggle buttons (USB / Serial)
  * Standardize button widths: 90px for toggle/action, 110px for Save/Delete/Clear/Export CSV
  * Speed tab: larger font for ISP, Country and Server; Country auto-populated via ip-api.com
  * Add openssh-client, samba, samba-common-bin as dependencies
  * Add python3-pyftpdlib as recommended dependency

